    "textTranslated": "It takes a really, really long time. The food is tasty, but definitely not worth the wait. The line looks okay, but you end up standing in an 8-meter queue for 1.5 hours waiting for your food. Go to another authentic spot, because this is more of a tourist hype/trend than a place where you will have a good döner experience."
